[00:20.54] Written by B. Setzer
[00:20.60] Switchblade 327
[00:22.42] Lit cigarette in his hand
[00:24.40] Steel-toed boots on the accelerator
[00:26.52] Oil leakin' outta the pan
[00:28.30] Switchblade, three two-barrels
[00:30.62] Gettin' there as fast as he can
[00:32.48] All juiced up like a hot carburetor
[00:34.68] Spittin' gas onto the fan
[00:36.66] Blacktop burnout, Saturday night
[00:38.80] Try to catch him if you can
[00:40.78] Switchblade 327
[00:42.88] Switchblade, seven come eleven
[00:44.92] Switchblade, he's all right
[00:46.78] When he gets drunk he fights all night
[01:05.52] Switchblade 327
[01:07.52] Pullin' way ahead of the pack
[01:09.20] Chop top deuce, Saturday night
[01:11.42] Flames shootin' outta the back
[01:13.20] Switchblade, don't cut him off
[01:15.60] He won't cut you no slack
[01:17.36] He'll cut you to ribbons if you come to town
[01:19.60] He'll carve his name in your back
[01:21.58] Blacktop burnout, Saturday night
[01:23.68] Try to catch him if you can
[01:25.74] Switchblade 327
[01:28.02] Switchblade, seven come eleven
[01:29.82] Switchblade, he's all right
[01:31.70] When he gets drunk he fights all night
[01:36.48] Switchblade 327
[02:15.84] Someone was calling his name
[02:17.84] All he could hear was his engine
[02:19.72] And the sound of the pouring down rain
[02:22.00] Switchblade 327
[02:24.00] Ran 125 down the lane
[02:26.20] But someone had cut both his fuel lines
[02:27.94] And the '32 burst into flames
[02:30.24] Blacktop burnout, Saturday night
[02:32.30] Try to catch him if you can
[02:34.34] Switchblade 327
[02:36.52] Switchblade, seven come eleven
[02:38.82] Switchblade, he's all right
